Changefeed design reference

SQLite session extension: ext/session/sqlite3session.c
https://sqlite.org/sessionintro.html
SQLite is in the public domain.

NexusQL uses the session extension's first-before-image/final-after-image design
as the model for transaction-scoped row changes. This module is an independent
Rust implementation; it contains no copied SQLite, DuckDB, PostGIS, or GEOS code.
Spatial membership calls NexusQL's existing ST_Covers implementation.
